,"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1035983/000110465926017530/fix-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc., a Delaware corporation, was established in 1997. We provide mechanical and electrical contracting services. Our mechanical segment principally includes heating, ventilation and air conditioning (\"HVAC\"), plumbing, piping and controls, as well as off-site construction, monitoring and fire protection. Our electrical segment includes installation and servicing of electrical systems. We build, install, maintain, repair and replace mechanical, electrical and plumbing (\"MEP\") systems through our 50 operating units with 190 locations in 142 cities throughout the United States.","zh":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc. 是一家特拉華州公司，成立於 1997 年。我們提供機械和電氣承包服務。我們的機械部門主要包括暖氣、通風和空調（「HVAC」）、管道、管道和控制，以及場外施工、監控和消防。我們的電氣部門包括電氣系統的安裝和維修。我們透過遍佈美國 142 個城市 190 個地點的 50 個營運單位建造、安裝、維護、維修和更換機械、電氣和管道 (“MEP”) 系統。"},{"en":"We operate primarily in the commercial, industrial and institutional MEP markets and perform most of our services in manufacturing, healthcare, education, office, technology, retail and government facilities. Substantially all of our consolidated 2025 revenue was derived from commercial, industrial and institutional customers and multi-family residential projects. Approximately 63.2% of our revenue was attributable to installation services in newly constructed facilities and 36.8% was attributable to renovation, expansion, maintenance, repair and replacement services in existing buildings. Our consolidated 2025 revenue was derived from the following service industries:","zh":"我們主要在商業、工業和機構機電市場開展業務，並在製造、醫療保健、教育、辦公、技術、零售和政府設施中提供大部分服務。我們的 2025 年合併收入基本上全部來自商業、工業和機構客戶以及多戶住宅專案。約63.2%的收入來自新建設施的安裝服務，36.8%來自現有建築的翻新、擴建、維護、修理和更換服務。我們的 2025 年合併收入來自以下服務業："},{"en":"We believe that commercial, industrial, and institutional mechanical and electrical contracting generate annual revenue in the United States of approximately $700 billion. Mechanical and electrical systems are necessary to virtually all commercial, industrial and institutional buildings. Because most buildings are sealed, HVAC systems provide the primary method of circulating fresh air in such buildings. Replacing an aging building's existing systems with modern, energy-efficient systems significantly reduces a building's energy consumption, carbon footprint, and operating costs while improving air quality and overall system effectiveness. Older commercial, industrial and institutional facilities frequently have poor air quality and provide less comfortable environments, and older HVAC systems result in significantly higher energy consumption than modern systems. As electrical systems ag","zh":"我們認為，商業、工業和機構機電承包在美國每年產生約 7,000 億美元的收入。機械和電氣系統幾乎是所有商業、工業和機構建築所必需的。由於大多數建築物都是密封的，暖通空調系統提供了在此類建築物中循環新鮮空氣的主要方法。以現代節能係統取代老化建築物的現有系統可顯著降低建築物的能源消耗、碳足跡和營運成本，同時提高空氣品質和整體系統效率。較舊的商業、工業和機構設施經常空氣品質較差，環境較不舒適，而且較舊的暖通空調系統導致能耗明顯高於現代系統。作為電氣系統股份公司"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We have a diverse customer base, with our top customer representing 12.8% of consolidated 2025 revenue. Our largest customer can change from year to year. Management and a dedicated sales force are responsible for developing and maintaining successful long-term relationships with key customers. Customers generally include building owners and developers and property managers, as well as general contractors, architects and consulting engineers. We intend to continue our emphasis on developing and maintaining long-term relationships with our customers by providing superior, high-quality service in a professional manner. We believe we can continue to leverage the diverse technical and marketing strengths at individual locations to expand the services offered in other local markets. With respect to multi-location service opportunities, we maintain a national sales force in our national accoun","zh":"我們擁有多元化的客戶群，我們的頂級客戶佔 2025 年綜合收入的 12.8%。我們最大的客戶每年都會有所變動。管理階層和專門的銷售人員負責與主要客戶建立並維持成功的長期關係。客戶通常包括業主、開發商和物業經理，以及總承包商、建築師和顧問工程師。我們打算繼續重視透過以專業的方式提供優質的服務來發展和維持與客戶的長期關係。我們相信，我們可以繼續利用各個地點的多樣化技術和行銷優勢來擴大在其他當地市場提供的服務。對於多地點服務機會，我們在全國範圍內擁有一支全國銷售隊伍"},{"en":"Employees—As of December 31, 2025, we had approximately 22,700 employees as compared to approximately 18,300 employees as of December 31, 2024. We have collective bargaining agreements covering 9 employees. We have not experienced and do not expect any significant strikes or work stoppages and believe our relations with employees covered by collective bargaining agreements are good.","zh":"員工－截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們約有 22,700 名員工，而截至 2024 年 12 月 31 日，我們擁有約 18,300 名員工。我們簽訂了涵蓋 9 名員工的集體談判協議。我們沒有經歷過、預計也不會發生任何重大罷工或停工，並相信我們與集體談判協議所涵蓋的員工關係良好。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The mechanical and electrical contracting industries are highly competitive and consist of thousands of local and regional companies. We believe that purchasing decisions in the commercial, industrial, and institutional markets are based on (i) competitive price, (ii) relationships, (iii) quality, timeliness, and reliability, (iv) tenure, financial strength,","zh":"機電承包行業競爭激烈，由數千家本地和區域公司組成。我們認為，商業、工業和機構市場的購買決策是基於 (i) 有競爭力的價格，(ii) 關係，(iii) 品質、及時性和可靠性，(iv) 任期、財務實力，"},{"en":"and access to bonding, (v) range of capabilities, and (vi) scale of operation. To improve our competitive position, we focus on both the consultative \"design and build\" installation market and the maintenance, repair, and replacement market to develop and strengthen customer relationships. In addition, we believe our ability to provide multi-location coverage and a broad range of services gives us a strategic advantage over smaller competitors who may have more limited resources and capabilities.","zh":"和獲得綁定的機會，(v) 能力範圍，以及 (vi) 營運規模。為了提高我們的競爭地位，我們專注於諮詢「設計和建造」安裝市場以及維護、維修和更換市場，以發展和加強客戶關係。此外，我們相信，我們提供多地點覆蓋和廣泛服務的能力使我們比資源和能力更有限的小型競爭對手更具戰略優勢。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Mechanical","val":6673745000,"zh":"機械部門"},{"name":"New Construction","val":5752786000,"zh":"新建築"},{"name":"Electrical","val":2427896000,"zh":"電氣部門"},{"name":"Existing Building Construction","val":2118363000,"zh":"現有建築施工"},{"name":"Service Calls Maintenance & Monitoring","val":661647000,"zh":"服務呼叫維護和監控"},{"name":"Service Projects","val":568845000,"zh":"服務項目"}],"total":9101641000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Mechanical","val":6673745000,"zh":"機械部門"},{"name":"Electrical","val":2427896000,"zh":"電氣部門"}],"total":9101641000}},"peers":["EME","STRL","PWR","POWL","IESC"]}}